OL,3,AChancellor John Healey in Commons to
OL,4,Adeliver his first Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has faced Kemi Badenoch in
OL,7,Fthe Commons for PMQs just before the
OL,8,FBudget statement, with the pair going
OL,9,Fback and forth on the UK's relationship
OL,10,Fwith the EU - watch live above
OL,12,FEarlier, the PM and Chancellor John
OL,13,FHealey spoke with Ukraine's President
OL,14,FZelensky, as the issue of defence
OL,15,Fspending looms over the Budget
OL,17,FThe chancellor, who was pictured
OL,18,Fholding the iconic red box, will
OL,19,Fdeliver his first Budget straight after
OL,20,FPMQs
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
